  "description": "bit Bsqlite: SQLite in the browser for Blazor, with EF Core on top. The ADO.NET surface with live queries, the worker transport (storage selection, engine-build negotiation, binary framing, batching, lifecycle), the storage provider contract, the in-memory backend, the EF Core integration (UseBitBsqlite() on the stock SQLite provider), and the browser half - worker host, wa-sqlite engine builds and the JavaScript API storage providers' VFSes extend.",
